            "summary": "As a former trustee and county commissioner, she honored Dr. Baker's legacy, described her collaborative history with him on Latino leadership initiatives, and enthusiastically endorsed Dr. Rubalcaba based on her four years of working with him on juvenile delinquency prevention efforts."
